LICENSE — TBD

The license for pakon-sane has not been finalized yet. SANE backends are
conventionally distributed under the GNU GPL (v2 or later); this is the likely
choice and must be confirmed and replaced with the full license text before any
public release (Phase 7 / 0.1 tag).

Note: the Intel HEX firmware blob shipped under firmware/ is a third-party
device-bootstrapping artifact with its own (separate) terms — see
firmware/README.md. It is not covered by this project's license.
